      "end_verse": 1,
      "title": "",
      "content": "(f-0) * (The title of this Book, 'Haggai'), Said to mean 'Festive' or 'Festival of Jehovah.' Darius (g-6) Darius Hystaspes. see Zech. 1.1; Ezra 4.24. by (h-25) Lit. 'by the hand of,' as often."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 4,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 4,
      "title": "",
      "content": "wainscoted (i-12) Or 'ceiled.' see Jer. 22.14."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 5,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 5,
      "title": "",
      "content": "Consider (k-8) Lit. 'Set your heart on.' so ch. 2.15,18, 'set your heart.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 7,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 7,
      "title": "",
      "content": "Consider (k-6) Lit. 'Set your heart on.' so ch. 2.15,18, 'set your heart.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 10,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 10,
      "title": "",
      "content": "you (a-3) Or 'for your sake.'"
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 1,
      "start_verse": 11,
      "end_chapter": 1,
      "end_verse": 11,
      "title": "",
      "content": "man, (b-37) Adam -- mankind."
